    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOnly once in a lifetime does a property of such character and beauty come to the market, with breathtaking and magnificent gardens that truly set it apart.\n\nSet amidst approximately 0.44 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds, this charming property is a gardener's delight. The gardens feature an exceptional array of unique and specimen plants and trees, colourful shrubs, mature herbaceous borders and a mature orchard, creating a private oasis of peace and tranquillity. The property also enjoys panoramic views over the surrounding countryside, providing a wonderful setting in which to relax and enjoy some downtime.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 60.80 sq. m. (654 sq. ft.) and comprises two bedrooms, kitchen, sitting room and bathroom. The property retains many of its original features and benefits from underfloor heating, combining traditional charm with modern comfort.\n\nExternally, there is a large shed, which has been newly roofed, providing excellent additional storage.\n\nIdeally located approximately 6.5 km from Killala, 19 km from Ballina and 60 km from Ireland West Airport Knock, the property offers a peaceful rural lifestyle while remaining within convenient reach of local amenities and transport links.\n\nA truly unique property with an exceptional garden and enormous charm — an opportunity not to be missed.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.82m x 2.95m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.65m x 4.13m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.22m x 1.82m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.03m x 3.74m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.08m x 2.42m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.83m x 2.97m\nW.C, W.H.B and shower\n\n"
